# Purpose: Find all log lines for an incident request ID and save a focused trace.
# Inputs: request-id.txt (one whitespace-free request identifier) and api.log (space-delimited records with the ID in field two).
# Outputs: Exact matching API log lines on stdout and in request-trace.txt.
accept api_path as text with default "api.log"
run cat with path api_path
pipe to awk with program "BEGIN { if ((getline target < \"request-id.txt\") !=1 || target==\"\") exit 2; close(\"request-id.txt\") } (\"x\" $2)==(\"x\" target) {print}"
then save to "request-trace.txt"
